## @@H_QUICK@@
<!-- README-SYNC:quick-start -->

@@QUICK1@@

~~~bash
python -m pip install --upgrade uag
uag
~~~

@@QUICK2@@

~~~bash
python -m pip install "uag[core,providers,tools]"
~~~

@@QUICK3@@

